ex:Mission11 backlog:hasMissionOutcome "Chapter 10 (deck 4.5.0, page 9.25.0) and chapter 11 (deck 4.4.0, page 9.26.0) show 37 code examples in one piece each, identical on slide and page, run on the page (410 and 414 page features passed), with a method guide for other chapters. Partial achievement: 27 of the 37 examples are traced to a block of the book's own code; the other 10 name a reason (the book gives no code block for the subject)." ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "All 19 stories and 39 tasks Done; five of six objectives met (differences 0, split boxes 0, examples run 37, verdicts 24, tools 3); traced examples 27 of 37, target missed. Not shown: the three-role review was made by the building agent and was given before the later changes; the 18 retrofitted pages have only the focused exam results test; the cause of the traced count moving from 25 to 27 was not traced. Details in the closure report." ;
